Subject: [PATCH] UBUNTU: SAUCE: dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Add HP EliteBook X G2q
 14 AI

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2167217

The HP EliteBook X G2q 14 AI is a Snapdragon X2 Elite (Glymur) laptop.
Document its top-level "hp,elitebook-x-g2q" compatible.

